<title>SWEDEN: S&amp;P raises Skandia claims-paying ratings.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P raises Skandia claims-paying ratings.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit rating agency Standard &amp; Poor's said on Monday it had raised the claims-paying ability ratings of Skandia Insurance Co Ltd and certain related entities to A from A-.</p>
<p>At the same time the agency lowered the claims-paying ability rating of Skandia International Insurance Corp to BBB+ from A-.</p>
</text>
